      "content": "thanks, i hope ur right. the pain is still pretty intense though. and the pulsing... it's really steady, like a actual heartbeat. i'm also starting to feel a bit lightheaded and kind of sweaty. i'm assuming that's just from being in so much pain? i don't want to drive myself to the hospital if i can just sleep it off with the benadryl like u said. is there anything else i can do for the dizziness right now?",
